      "id": 9544030978360,
      "title": "Replacement Part: Nex Playground Remote Control",
      "handle": "nex-playground-remote-control-unit",
      "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>Direct replacement part only – not intended for use with any device other than Nex Playground.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>2 x AAA batteries included</li>\n<li>Ship in replacement part packaging</li>\n<li>Ship to addresses in the U.S. only</li>\n</ul>\n<p>While waiting for a new remote to arrive, you might be able to <a href=\"https://help.nexplayground.com/#rp-customer-widget-faq-78c975f8-dd90-4ac0-901d-2d34dfe38bd6\">use your TV remote to control Playground</a>.</p>",
