    {
      "id": 9508990648632,
      "title": "Nex Playground Travel Case",
      "handle": "nex-playground-travel-case",
      "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Bring Playground with you anywhere with the official Nex Playground Travel Case. Designed to securely transport all system components including Playground console, HDMI cable, power supply and remote control (all sold separately).</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Bring the fun everywhere</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The good times don't have to stay at home. Pack up the joy for family get-togethers or friend-fueled play dates and take the laughter and smiles whenever you go.</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Perfect fit for Playground</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Designed to fit Playground plus all of the necessary accessories including remote, power cord and HDMI cable.</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Secure, durable and lightweight</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Features a lightweight construction with super-soft lining and a sturdy foam frame, plus straps to keep accessories snug while on the go.</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<strong>Specifications</strong><br>\n</h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li>Dimensions - 7.87 x 7.68 x 3.82 inches<!-- notionvc: d913cac6-9398-4c3a-841e-778af9d38812 --> / <meta charset=\"utf-8\">200 x 195 x 97 mm</li>\n<li>Weight - 0.73 lbs / <meta charset=\"utf-8\">333 g</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>FAQ</strong></h3>\n<ol style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li>Does it fit version 1 remote (with joystick)? Yes, it does.</li>\n<li>Is it water-resistant or water-repellent? No, it is not.</li>\n<li>How can it be cleaned? Soak a cloth in water with a neutral detergent, wring out any excess water and wipe it clean. Then, wipe it again with a soft, dry cloth. Avoid using thinner, benzene or alcohol.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>While supplies last. </strong></p>\n<!---->",
